Optional dependency (Maven profile "ocr", not built by default)
============================================================================

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tess4J 5.13.0  --  local OCR fallback for scanned pages
  net.sourceforge.tess4j:tess4j
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
License: Apache License 2.0
Usage:   ocr/TesseractOcrEngine, invoked reflectively so the main source set
         compiles and runs whether or not this jar is present. Only reached
         when OCR_ENGINE=tesseract (M8-CONTRACTS.md §0.4); the default build
         and the default configuration never touch it.

Note: Tess4J is a JNA wrapper around the Tesseract OCR engine (Apache-2.0),
which must be installed on the host separately along with its language data.
Neither the wrapper nor the engine performs any network request at inference
time. Language data packs are distributed by the Tesseract project under
Apache-2.0; verify the terms of whichever packs a deployment actually
installs, as third-party trained data is sometimes published under other
terms.
